The '''Ship''' or '''Ship Navigator''' is a feature unlocked at {{Skill|Fishing|5}} that allows the player to travel to the {{Zone|Backwater Bayou}} and {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Accessing ==
The '''Ship''' can be first accessed in the {{Zone|Fishing Outpost}} by speaking to {{NPCSprite|Captain Baha}}, after unlocking {{Skill|Fishing|5}}. He will task the player with fishing up and bringing him the {{Item|Rusty Ship Engine}}, which can then be applied to the '''Ship Navigator''' to unlock it.

The ship can then be seen on other [[Fishing]] islands, including the {{Zone|Backwater Bayou}} and {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Usage ==
=== Ship Navigator ===
The front of the '''Ship''' features a {{Rmt|&6&lSHIP NAVIGATOR}} hologram. Clicking it opens a menu that allows the players to travel to certain [[Fishing]]-related islands.

Each of these islands have their own requirements, [[Sea Creatures]], and [[Chapters]] associated with them. Completing all the chapters for a given island will unlock its [[#Golden Pearls|Golden Pearl]].
