=== Ship Crew ===
The '''Ship Crew''' is a feature unlocked at {{Skill|Fishing|10}} that allows the player to persuade [[NPCs]] to join the ship. Each crewmate grants a unique reward, which can include access to new [[Fishing]] islands, and can be seen visibly on the ship.

Despite the unlock requirement, {{NPCSprite|Captain Baha}} is always visibly part of the crew, although his {{Stat|fishing wisdom}} buff does still require {{Skill|Fishing|10}}.
